# Code Standards & Styling Rules

1. Always use tokens from `AppColors`, `AppTypography`, `AppSpacing`, and `AppRadii`. Never hardcode raw hex colors or arbitrary font sizes.
2. Adhere to **Obsidian Pulse** aesthetic (pitch black void `#080808`, `#141414` surface cards, 1px borders, Inter typography).
3. Ensure all interactive tap elements satisfy minimum $44 \times 44\text{pt}$ hit-test boundaries.
4. Run `flutter analyze` and `flutter test` before completing any feature to maintain 0 warnings and passing tests.
